="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="726" width="210" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c82" value="Annotations: open loans are listed soonest due first, with an Overdue badge once the due date has passed. The form posts with a CSRF token; a barcode with no open loan is refused with HTTP 422 (&quot;nothing to return&quot;) and nothing is written. Success redirects with HTTP 303. The late fee (BR 02, FR 11) is recorded in a later step; the page shows days late. Admin role only (BR 10)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#8a969b;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="774" width="1110" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>